WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:11.150
19. Our little green friends. Many people use plants to improve the appearance of their homes.

2
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:16.150
Plants have been shown to reduce stress and noise and to help us focus on our work.

3
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:20.150
But did you know that houseplants can also improve your health?

4
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:26.150
By the process of photosynthesis, plants take in carbon dioxide and give out oxygen.

5
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:29.150
Of course, humans need oxygen to breathe.

6
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:36.150
The oxygen given out by plants helps us to breathe more deeply and stops us from feeling tired.

7
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:41.150
Some plants can also absorb harmful chemicals from the air inside our houses.

8
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:45.150
Experts suggest placing one plant every nine square meters.

9
00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:52.150
The average American home measures 232 square meters, which means it should have around 25 plants.

10
00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:57.150
That may sound like a lot, but remember this is an investment in your health.

11
00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:00.150
Some plants produce more oxygen than others.

12
00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:05.150
Tropical plants produce the most because their natural environment is the forest floor.

13
00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:11.150
They have adapted to survive even when they can't get much sunlight through the trees above them.

14
00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:14.150
Forest ferns are among the best plants for the home.

15
00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:20.150
Not only do they produce oxygen, but they also absorb formaldehyde, which can cause cancer.

16
00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:24.150
Ferns have no seeds or flowers, but they do have attractive leaves.

17
00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:30.150
The most beautiful option is the Gerbera daisy, which is known to help people sleep.

18
00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:36.150
While most plants produce oxygen during the day, these brightly colored flowers work right through the night.

19
00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:44.150
Money plants, spider plants, and snake plants, sometimes called mother-in-law's tongue, also make good house plants.

20
00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:51.150
However, the leaves of money plants can be dangerous if eaten by small children or pets, so be careful.
